-- Their benefit was deferred but regulation 18 gives me a lump sum.
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to a survivor's State Pension based on my late spouse's deferred or increased graduated retirement benefit` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2020 1 1) `married to each other` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2010 3 1) FALSE FALSE TRUE `a lump sum under regulation 19`)
-- Neither an increase nor a deferral.
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to a survivor's State Pension based on my late spouse's deferred or increased graduated retirement benefit` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2020 1 1) `married to each other` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2010 3 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE `regulation 18 does not cover the person`)
-- I have not reached pensionable age on the day I ask about.
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to a survivor's State Pension based on my late spouse's deferred or increased graduated retirement benefit` (YMD 2019 12 31) (YMD 2020 1 1) `married to each other` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2010 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE `regulation 18 does not cover the person`)
-- They did not die while we were married.
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to a survivor's State Pension based on my late spouse's deferred or increased graduated retirement benefit` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2020 1 1) `married to each other` FALSE FALSE (YMD 2010 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE `regulation 18 does not cover the person`)
-- I married again before reaching pensionable age.
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to a survivor's State Pension based on my late spouse's deferred or increased graduated retirement benefit` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2020 1 1) `married to each other` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2010 3 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE `regulation 18 does not cover the person`)
-- I was over pensionable age when they died and married again: irrelevant.
#ASSERT `Am I entitled to a survivor's State Pension based on my late spouse's deferred or increased graduated retirement benefit` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2016 5 1) `married to each other` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2016 6 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE `regulation 18 does not cover the person`
-- They died on the day I reached pensionable age (F20).
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to a survivor's State Pension based on my late spouse's deferred or increased graduated retirement benefit` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2010 3 1) `married to each other` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2010 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE `regulation 18 does not cover the person`)

-- Q45. What weekly rate of State Pension do I get under regulation 20, in pounds (reg 20(2))?
-- A rate of 12.
