§§ `If I live abroad (regs 21 to 23)`

-- Q47. Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas (reg 21)?
-- Not deferred, entitled and overseas when the increase comes in.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2027 4 1) FALSE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the person is not entitled to the up-rating increase under regulation 21`
-- Entitled but not overseas.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2027 4 1) FALSE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `regulation 21 does not take the up-rating increase away`
-- Overseas but not entitled.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2027 4 1) FALSE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `regulation 21 does not take the up-rating increase away`
-- Regulations have not been made applying regulation 21 to this increase.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` FALSE (YMD 2027 4 1) FALSE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `regulation 21 does not apply to this up-rating increase`
-- Deferred in 2025, entitled and overseas when it ended; an increase on 1 April 2025 during the deferral, overseas throughout.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2025 4 1) TRUE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the person is not entitled to the up-rating increase under regulation 21`
-- The same, but not overseas throughout the deferral.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2025 4 1) TRUE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `regulation 21 does not take the up-rating increase away`
-- An increase on the first day of the deferral counts as during it.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2025 1 1) TRUE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the person is not entitled to the up-rating increase under regulation 21`
-- An increase on the last day of the deferral counts as during it.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2025 12 31) TRUE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the person is not entitled to the up-rating increase under regulation 21`
-- An increase the day after the deferral ended, while overseas.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the person is not entitled to the up-rating increase under regulation 21`
-- An increase after the deferral, no longer overseas.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2026 4 1) TRUE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `regulation 21 does not take the up-rating increase away`
-- An increase before the deferral began: in neither (a) nor (b), and (5) is for the other cases.
#ASSERT `Is my up-rating increase taken away because I live overseas` TRUE (YMD 2024 4 1) TRUE (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `regulation 21 does not take the up-rating increase away`

-- Q48. Is the place where I live a territory specified for the State Pension (reg 21(6))?
-- Channel Islands, no Order.
#ASSERT `Is the place where I live a territory specified for the State Pension` TRUE FALSE
-- Channel Islands, covered by an Order.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the place where I live a territory specified for the State Pension` TRUE TRUE)
-- Elsewhere.
