-- The same, but the Secretary of State considers the level appropriate.
#ASSERT `Am I credited with a Class 3 contribution for this week because I am engaged in caring` 20 FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- No application.
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I credited with a Class 3 contribution for this week because I am engaged in caring` 20 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- Schedule 1B applies: no hours and no application needed.
